<title>AUSTRALIA: Ticor narrows 1997 half-year loss.</title>
<headline>Ticor narrows 1997 half-year loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 loss 4.39 vs loss 9.99</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 4.39 vs loss 9.99</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  129.80 vs 116.33</p>
<p>NOTE: Ticor Ltd, a diverse mining and engineering group, with investments in titanium pigment manufacture, mineral sands mining and processing and coal mining, is 35 percent owned by South African-based steel group Iscor Ltd.</p>
